  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Playing with Fire: Using Forum Theatre to Research Social Conflict in the Aftermath of 2019 Bolivian Wildland Fires</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation of Forum Theatre play performed with residents from Bolivia&#x2019;s Chiquitania to understand how performing arts can support community&#x2019;s response to socio-environmental emergencies, particularly wildfires, promoting social benefit. SDG: 13,15,16</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
